nk this shouldn't be happening, especially when manually unwrapping the operator makes the warning go away. ``variable += value`` is the same as ``variable = variable + value`` and I think it should be treated the same. Especially after applying the exact fix mentioned in the warning description.\n\n<img width=\"986\" height=\"158\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/15f96fe8-dbeb-4501-adf3-497e49ab4b3e\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThis code snippet should reproduce the problem:\n```gdscript\nenum GaitMode{\n\tWALK = 0,\n\tTROT = 1,\n\tGALLOP = 2\n}\n\nvar gait : GaitMode = GaitMode.WALK\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tprint(gait)\n\tgait = gait + 1 as GaitMode\n\tprint(gait)\n\tgait += 1 as GaitMode\n\tprint(gait)\n```\nJust to make sure, the output is as expected:\n```\n0\n1\n2\n--- Debugging process stopped ---\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"AidasLit","id":129107308,"node_id":"U_kgDOB7IFbA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129107308?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AidasLit","html_url":"https://github.com/AidasLit","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AidasLit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AidasLit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AidasLit/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AidasLit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AidasLit/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AidasLit/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AidasLit/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AidasLit/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AidasLit/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116758/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confu